5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to ensure we have the staff to actually run these plans. I'll check the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm looking at the actual passenger experience. I'll take the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am concerned with the long-term financial commitments. I will examine the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must not repeat old mistakes. I shall look into the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme and the two pilots from eight years ago.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I want to know what might stall us. I'll investigate the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, do you think the budget will allow for new hires if the rosters are empty?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, do those old pilots actually tell us anything about today's crowds?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"That is precisely why I am checking the ledger, Asuka. We need to see what is actually available.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"History often rhymes, Takumi. Knowing what worked then helps us avoid delusions now.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I suspect the administrative hurdles are where the real delays hide.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
